    "created_at": "2025-04-22T14:54:06Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-22T14:54:06Z",
    "body": "Non-UTF8 usage is [absolute zero](https://glam.telemetry.mozilla.org/fog/probe/web_notification_icon_url_encoding/explore?activeBuckets=%5B%22either_way%22%2C%22utf8%22%2C%22document_charset%22%2C%22neither_way%22%5D&aggType=avg&app_id=release&ping_type=*&timeHorizon=ALL). (It's all \"either way\", meaning the URL decoding result for icon is always same regardless of whether it's by UTF8 or by the document charset.)\n\nWe'll start making it always UTF8.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
